{
  "schema": 1,
  "rows": {
    "33:11": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "fe5348cb871a2c6701ef896988f9c4e11b9d4103a7debcef9ae36203f6fcd91f",
      "en": "「Your moonlight is beautiful.」"
    },
    "33:36": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "eeb8d3cfd6387d80905d69141a8bae9966849d3eb47671c66ec02eb476640c9b",
      "en": "「You and I... which is better suited\\nto raise the sun overhead?」"
    },
    "33:95": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d69e6b8bd5b661331936c3ab813c98de955ad1cf65bca0d2c205383d211ebefd",
      "en": "「Boy though you are, you have the\\ncaliber to stand above others.」"
    },
    "33:152": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8b7f128f947124d3a78f38922cc22859ff3837b565dd7a67ffcea4cc854cd739",
      "en": "「Your boyish sense of justice, which\\nwon't forgive evil, is endearing.」"
    },
    "33:209": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "48b7acc0e75a53aa2bcc6b888cf54419dd9dd3bd5ca19457e7317a14bd8f42b4",
      "en": "「I honor you and your brother's love.」"
    },
    "33:244": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "261a08faa8bad119448ab30b2a2ade92f2bd112d863337d89c218d0a537271eb",
      "en": "「$$異能生存体$$.\\nYou don't have to fight any more.」"
    },
    "33:295": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "743fd25a85301243af3c50bfbc3dbf6327cb802f8e84e8583411e452e48a0266",
      "en": "「You who were guided by $$ガンダム$$.\\nI welcome your evolution.」"
    },
    "33:348": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "951b358de2434897e5a188042f43153e0ef463fbbcad87964466f3435dd2d13c",
      "en": "「You have the aptitude to move on,\\nbeyond the civilization of fire.」"
    },
    "33:399": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b927a36d73e739f7d60e9b7371fcd0ee7e35cfd475af64c074fdfb9e895445a0",
      "en": "「Understanding... what lovely words.」"
    },
    "33:432": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2a18938ee19da8e284d65901df01ef8242534f63e582f58718207bee14bfdf46",
      "en": "「Turning feelings into power...\\nThat is the civilization of fire.」"
    },
    "33:481": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2ae9923b2acbacf673cd03fe847428bf534f951297e3a8ad02d4d53144c580cf",
      "en": "「Come, heir to the beast's blood.」"
    },
    "33:518": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "88e0dba46d29834e080c8c16c3e16dcef0ddb8d61bb5bb57172174465adbef8c",
      "en": "「$$始原の特異点$$... Unwelcome.」"
    },
    "33:559": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "bfd4dc49052a718c12f8d074dccb4bed3ed39b8595d901fb0c1ae4bf0fb0847d",
      "en": "「A fine song.\\nI feel life surging out of you.」"
    },
    "33:614": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "1fd4b545c7bd171154b7bbfb58f1a012877d180603e93a83376f5530c26475f5",
      "en": "「Wings that carry your feelings...\\nIt's a pity to snap them off.」"
    },
    "33:667": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "3a851aa77c63a6180e93fb5cceb1ce9aaefcdca72e35fe43107fb9fbfc30e632",
      "en": "「The Demon God of Light pales to my light.」"
    },
    "33:710": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e5d80b5c5727d820c60c4e205401dba75be97ec0740949e96fe79278588fd89c",
      "en": "「$$ゲッター線$$ warrior... Be at peace.」"
    },
    "33:753": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "1494583329338712e4a82a586be53a108437dd721f2c00293ea91541e3782b23",
      "en": "「You need not worry about salaries\\nor the recession any more.」"
    },
    "33:812": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "676fafad54f72ff88369cbc7b72e55eae0ab189bfd97f3754b5fdaeac71a721d",
      "en": "「Dominus of $$ザ・ビッグ$$...\\nYou should grasp the will of God.」"
    },
    "33:875": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "98a554abc21154994230f78bdf972bd104fa59ebd09d0d2e42e3ade96f7473e8",
      "en": "「You, who denied the power of a king,\\ncannot overturn God's will.」"
    },
    "33:926": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4aa5ea5721d209b943c4be78fc394679fa2f34f9af81dd5c52af6636d82956ea",
      "en": "「Ugly... Those who live by war.」"
    },
    "33:963": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "42e47173b9939050f26047c3287a99938627306975f197a8e12a964626381a4e",
      "en": "「You turn feelings into power.\\nBut it won't reach me.」"
    },
    "33:1012": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "42b53556cdfd3463d7c3de6094db094e59437b3670ef0213241e980db502b4ac",
      "en": "「Your existence may transcend both\\ncausality and infinity.」"
    },
    "33:1069": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "efc737e0eaa64bff9c096cc80bc2b39c892f3072cefbf5a61246baec12f9b09d",
      "en": "「Mechanical Angel of mingled waters... Lovely.」"
    },
    "33:1112": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "580cae1f6e423861f6d1e67fa8db2988c2ab408a1ac2757f38dd0b68edc7c7f1",
      "en": "「The fire that burned $$バアル$$ away...\\nSimply beautiful...」"
    },
    "33:1161": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ef575313b0bc594cdd80a8662b2b0b3c66e96a2de2b6f301411b5531d4277240",
      "en": "「Your power is the same as the\\ninnocence only children possess.」"
    },
    "33:1212": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "59a45be693afec3503ec233bc6f43db54617011f898daea6c1605836693b589f",
      "en": "「There are things effort and grit\\ncannot overcome. That is me.」"
    },
    "33:1271": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5837ab76aab4ace3f09518fbde24b12fa485cee447179048f9738a128fd47c04",
      "en": "「The spiral wind's destination lies\\nin the palm of my hand.」"
    },
    "33:1324": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "fd9b19e02615823e67d92cde4bd90fb42b0887588a60fc8d11ec3c95dc2fb355",
      "en": "「Breaking the natural order...\\nI doubt I could like such a being.」"
    },
    "33:1385": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5c531f5c3408823edd5f3603f5d7194f1b3068a93f59be542cf8a2d46d7af9b1",
      "en": "「I'll save you before you're crushed\\nby the burden of freedom you gained.」"
    },
    "33:1434": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "53914d2e09d9569656656087a830b2a7e0f879ad7725cc7b1843448027b44037",
      "en": "「The crystal of Earth humanity's will\\nand wisdom I will bury by my hand.」"
    },
    "33:1487": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8547ee0db17b0611986bd2237aad1dbe5bfa75909c81d58a018dccaae6c53270",
      "en": "「The $$黒い太陽#sol$$ awaits your $$スフィア$$s.」"
    },
    "33:1528": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5dfeb43d9dbf6f8e3e124a873025299fa59f849c2da35e2cb240e758d3fa71a2",
      "en": "「$$セツコ$$... I'll banish all your sorrow.」"
    },
    "33:1569": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4e83207cd44efb651c25bf0fb341ae541370eb9a3f22918d42f39985e9b58e2d",
      "en": "「$$ランド$$... I will take on your pain.」"
    },
    "33:1610": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "90ca962ccf4ea658e04c571ab140e3d5895ddb0ab0d9eadaa93b2a3ae2c6a42e",
      "en": "「$$クロウ$$...\\nI'll catch your unwavering will.」"
    },
    "33:1665": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2179f5e40d299528d44c89d34107f3dcb26c2bc6c9f75c0937dfa5b538186a29",
      "en": "「You will suffer no more...\\nYou are mine.」"
    },
    "33:1714": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "96fb15f4a09f651bc05d6ff5306dd0f16f4bc31f8d3494e1e211202c256ef9f6",
      "en": "「I've long awaited your awakening.」"
    },
    "33:2014": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e2d7b4099cf25aad8c2f658afbc4eba41269e8c371998a7b15089b9ba732ef74",
      "en": "「This is not the end... It's a start.」"
    },
    "33:2055": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "58f02e99216db29bc3b7cc040484642ed19b74544cc2e1234133f364372be89e",
      "en": "「I shall carry your memories\\nto the next universe.」"
    },
    "33:2104": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5960a8af83b30b02688dac13e0cf9d9adeec9c96370c2436a901fdf9af74b7c0",
      "en": "「I loved you...\\nAnd that is why I will defeat you.」"
    },
    "33:2159": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "460fea018c9f15977019daf576975b6a9645b64ab0ea013f5eabae5c7a8096ed",
      "en": "「Having overcome the pain,\\nmy heart is now full of true joy.」"
    },
    "33:2216": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6f324dd836e83edfff94d670f6abc91cb763160f6774ab41046e1af9eaee4a29",
      "en": "「Not punishment... this is salvation.」"
    },
    "33:2253": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "33d001fc76efc2b2075eb45e82d582ec2299734fe3a94bf82b8da4c17896ddbe",
      "en": "「Joy to you, held by the Supreme God.」"
    },
    "33:2284": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6b44fcfb28807f035bb03fac93ed54fd13cffa3610f9fffe2a0eaafe5e4abb6a",
      "en": "「Dear ones... I will not forget you.」"
    },
    "33:2323": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9140eb1d19b616186ef176854e663226a45b237aeca161ce74c07983f6923afa",
      "en": "「This is the last light I give you.」"
    },
    "33:2684": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "533a649a7b6939939c86e2619d74aa9423c51f80be331fad3d3b8411b81df239",
      "en": "「I honor your tireless will to fight.」"
    },
    "33:2725": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "33f18fdc80c10f0879cf53c420a4d73cabd7681a7fc5ceea1108c64d611ca5cb",
      "en": "「It seems you yourself wish for ruin?」"
    },
    "33:2764": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "7388d478ffadaf5a966e22641a6f823a708e9c78047f6ff295d51d765e3b251d",
      "en": "「Do you want punishment or salvation?」"
    },
    "33:2805": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4564f2c975201543c92a243b2b664ff45b6453e36746f243c1213eb0d172ab43",
      "en": "「Why choose to die in such agony?」"
    },
    "33:2844": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "779abae0d4c5dd292d8167cd5b89be72ce6b39dcc4340c71b54b61fb7f3f6b1a",
      "en": "「Why do you\\nthrow your own life away like that?」"
    },
    "33:2893": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "dba2edd942b3fc8ecf1bad986d31451c5c07055cce12253e44000a78789f2800",
      "en": "「This universe has no escape left.」"
    },
    "33:2932": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b4120f65cfd3f73b0ae84e0080517701f16684f5c2cefe7c1223702401dfad3e",
      "en": "「I became a god to save everything.」"
    },
    "33:2362": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b4fce75f62ba74839e5ec5acb65fa76baf2debcd7916ce823f79aa1db774a3ca",
      "en": "「If you wish, I'll give it endlessly.」"
    },
    "33:2399": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "80d99727e95ea43a0fe973ca94bca50434c6be4e027625dcdb56bebc05c7a279",
      "en": "「The Supreme God still desires you.」"
    },
    "33:1757": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a1e9a1ef2f206060d6eae5c3222fc93a4a8cfd342f99ae3d3855a826e62268de",
      "en": "「You seem unworthy of being\\na $$スフィア・リアクター$$.」"
    },
    "33:1812": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2e87667e8b112a9332342a4d37ace4d9e268526f897932227466f41eeee75989",
      "en": "「$$セツコ$$... Your being saddens me.」"
    },
    "33:1849": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e8cc7f548d61d59c046fc0438fd3090aa288aeb1c2330eadf19c1e23fc8457b8",
      "en": "「$$ランド$$...\\nIf this is your fervor, how sad.」"
    },
    "33:1900": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "0ad11230c5a19c170ec73d861653a4013a3dd35d255467f199d276d4098993f3",
      "en": "「$$クロウ$$...\\nDo you see me as a $$次元獣$$?」"
    },
    "33:1955": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "319ddc55648900ab6bd26cadb4302e69e7bf7765fec864ad0359ea2c737a70d1",
      "en": "「You think you've broken your limits,\\nbut here is the result.」"
    },
    "33:3198": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6bd22f8a03e6c10689d30ec462b065432f34560ec6a17516bd8555e954b97e68",
      "en": "「Even $$真化融合$$ has this limit.」"
    },
    "33:3239": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d2a0d4e99ed34dc45c0a1a0bd58aa77e135aae803f936c76caee8b7fc252be52",
      "en": "「What humans can do is limited.」"
    },
    "33:3272": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d17e0c4b28321cde503ed33eb2adadca73d87329bab4e36757e153a8ca4b6f60",
      "en": "「Struggle with all your might.\\nThough there's no time left.」"
    },
    "33:3331": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "be696148b36d77b392922d6adc2eae32b5c6b13f425d4837cb5b097cda21bbba",
      "en": "「By taking your attack, I will\\nbring peace to your heart.」"
    },
    "33:3384": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "24967b600c4122e55b736387a89e640f88faa47b345d9904dcf8b6b082ab5707",
      "en": "「Accepting you is my role as well.」"
    },
    "33:3421": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e02ca3c442aa94a0764879267bf29c013bf4086fe8fc6fc145a51f751246cc90",
      "en": "「The light of the Supreme God\\ncannot be put out by that.」"
    },
    "33:3470": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "25ee5277eefc26933ffd3683fee65d4eeab38470cdfe3b1b9c37090a46527fd3",
      "en": "「Even if you refuse salvation,\\nI will never reject you.」"
    },
    "33:3523": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e96a8af75094d0f8199564d96b6fa297011f1f808b2baf103199de3b05014ead",
      "en": "「Facing the universe's great collapse,\\nyou can't stay calm, I see.」"
    },
    "33:3578": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6b930400d89de584664f2b4227a58baac72ed3bce3ae256a997d018dcfd68ec5",
      "en": "「$$セツコ$$...\\nAs a god, I'll embrace your sorrow.」"
    },
    "33:3629": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c07695acea1b27d1bccc2ec0ff208044cc743926b5f9c74db240bfa4d8286895",
      "en": "「$$ランド$$... Even your fervor is but\\na dying flame before the Supreme God.」"
    },
    "33:3692": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4221f01722dd3bd87eea2856c041518f0981984ecc9ed1403dd0d4533db629e1",
      "en": "「$$クロウ$$... My will now has\\nstrength that surpasses even yours.」"
    },
    "33:3753": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "1d6991f49fa872a3736097757fa06fecf73ef74ffbfeb0232ec1e363563a3eb6",
      "en": "「You were the Reactor meant to be the\\ncore of the Supreme God... and yet.」"
    },
    "33:3061": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c4953574808d76bf038000a4cd26ee38f1c4bf58734b82bdbbd591cf7441e3ff",
      "en": "「Fear and impatience torment you.」"
    },
    "33:3102": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9c003ca887eb9dac52ec8a56e7da63f1d78ac74e68c5c449e21ae2cbaecd3c2c",
      "en": "「Warping space lets me do this much.」"
    },
    "33:3145": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f0d3a22a9a3dceac120cf251a0028ba5831b501701d8dacd24cf8938f5c6c46e",
      "en": "「I have no intention of running.\\nI'll be waiting for you here.」"
    },
    "33:2971": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d2f059ed5e933b4c4c43db29734c89321cff0787c3bcac4f2d6bb671fabc0676",
      "en": "「I foresaw all this. No surprise.」"
    },
    "33:3012": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "adc9db1cfea9b0c89a575c1b5c07cc44b32f11cdcc2f8e71597b966145f5080a",
      "en": "「Enjoy the life that's been extended\\nfor just a few minutes.」"
    },
    "33:2432": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c1809c7c8ab3ed84155b69a2c70e9161e5760e3a061312a131d46b606ac0d37d",
      "en": "「I'll show you every universe's end.」"
    },
    "33:2467": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "464191339119d36915a8cc2f11d85afe945cc225297b0c33146ee7cf85835bc1",
      "en": "「That is my salvation!」"
    },
    "33:2490": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "35f64b4b2f9316e3d9ff33f2d0061a49eac096109d4cfe9c6a184fadbd81dbf5",
      "en": "「You'll see the causal horizon's end...」"
    },
    "33:2521": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "35624306003a5a1e625f88a6d1c2a4ede0e443cf1204985c7a5d9e54aaf16f15",
      "en": "「And then, you will return to me!」"
    },
    "33:2554": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d10a8fa3c388535bf39d87e020624852d1813eeb3a15fe0260ab5c7eeb7dd3f5",
      "en": "「Ultium Deus Initium...」"
    }
  },
